689618b3-66d8-8010-be84-1e241efe5906</guid><pubDate>Fri, 08 Aug 2025 18:31:13 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Nabeel’s review]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1857140980421668864/0prdKK32_200x200.jpg"></p><p>Nabeel S. Qureshi (@nabeelqu) on X</p><p>Ok, collecting my overall GPT-5 impressions: - Biggest upgrade seems to be 4o -&gt; 5. I rarely use these models but for the median user this is a huge upgrade.
